WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:07.529
(calm electronic music)

00:00:55.904 --> 00:00:58.323
- [Narrator] I just like
it when my kids get up,

00:00:58.323 --> 00:01:00.839
and they're in a good mood
and they're all smiling.

00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:04.172
That's my bit, the first bit of the day.

00:01:08.456 --> 00:01:11.716
- [Narrator] Family don't cost nothing.

00:01:11.716 --> 00:01:15.383
It's like your mom is
like your best friend.

00:01:24.387 --> 00:01:26.720
(whistling)

00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:36.085
- [Narrator] She puts on a big smiling face.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:42.113
She's only one; she's
small, but she's lovely.

00:01:45.117 --> 00:01:46.971
- [Narrator] I like being outside.

00:01:46.971 --> 00:01:51.138
So, like when the weather's really
warm, I like looking at trees.

00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:02.404
- [Narrator] Me, and I make
it for me, for my dress

00:02:02.404 --> 00:02:06.071
is a lovely color, and
it's a proud feeling.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:07.876
I am happy.

00:02:34.262 --> 00:02:36.080
- [Narrator] It's strangers smiling.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.986
It's strangers dancing with strangers.

00:02:37.986 --> 00:02:39.986
That's what's community.

00:02:43.786 --> 00:02:45.935
- [Narrator] The sound that the bike makes

00:02:45.935 --> 00:02:49.729
when he's arriving at home
just makes me very happy

00:02:49.729 --> 00:02:50.896
because, yeah.

00:03:02.803 --> 00:03:05.837
- [Narrator] I like having a
bacon sandwich on my balcony.

00:03:05.837 --> 00:03:08.244
(laughter)

00:03:08.244 --> 00:03:10.979
- [Narrator] So I would
be very happy, likely.

00:03:10.979 --> 00:03:12.899
- [Narrator] Probably friends because

00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:14.363
they're always there for you.

00:03:14.363 --> 00:03:16.071
- [Narrator] Finding
dinosaurs in the fruit bowl.

00:03:16.071 --> 00:03:18.050
That makes me happy.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.679
- [Narrator] Going different places,

00:03:19.679 --> 00:03:21.738
meeting different people
and different cultures.

00:03:21.738 --> 00:03:23.213
- [Narrator] Just that
gentleman over there.

00:03:23.213 --> 00:03:24.325
He makes me happy.

00:03:24.325 --> 00:03:25.719
- [Narrator] Cycling with my mates.

00:03:25.719 --> 00:03:27.249
- [Narrator] Playing Legos.

00:03:27.249 --> 00:03:28.598
- [Narrator] Live music.

00:03:28.598 --> 00:03:30.598
- I love pizza.
- Coffee?

00:03:31.905 --> 00:03:36.072
- [Narrator] Her laugh, her
laugh is really, really crazy.

